hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"318","[AI-translation] Hamein Mahmood bin Ghailan ne hadith sunai, kaha: Hamein Abu Dawood ne hadith sunai, kaha: Hamein Shu'bah ne hadith sunai, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, unhoon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah bin Mughaffal ko kehte suna: Maine Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Fath ke din apni oontni par dekha, aur woh parh rahe the: Beshak hum ne tumhein ek roshan fath ata ki, taake Allah tumhein tumhare pehle aur baad ke gunah maaf kar de. Kaha: To unhon ne parha aur tarannum kiya. Kaha: Aur Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah ne kaha: Agar log mujh par jama na ho jatein to main tumhare liye us awaz ki naqal utar deta, ya kaha: us lehje ki."
"319","[AI-translation] Hamein Qutaybah bin Sa'eed ne hadees bayan ki, unhone kaha: Hamein Nuh bin Qais Al-Huddani ne hadees bayan ki, Husam bin Misk se, Qatadah se. Unhone kaha: Allah ne koi Nabi mab'ooth nahi farmaya magar khoob chehre aur khoob aawaz wala, aur aap ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khoob chehre aur khoob aawaz wale the, aur woh aawaz ko palat kar na padhte the."
"320","[AI-translation] Hamein Abdullah bin Abdur-Rahman ne hades bayan kiya, kehne lage: Hamein Yahya bin Hassan ne hades bayan kiya, kehne lage: Hamein Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Az-Zinad ne hades bayan kiya, Amr bin Abi Amr se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki tilawat aisi hoti thi, ke kabhi hujre mein mojood shakhs bhi sun leta jabke aap ghar mein hote."
"321","[AI-translation] Haddasana Suwayd bin Nasr, qala: Haddasana Abdullah bin Al-Mubarak, 'an Hammad bin Salamah, 'an Thabit, 'an Mutarrif wa huwa ibn Abdullah bin Ash-Shikhkhir, 'an abihi, qala: Main Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaya, aap namaaz padh rahe the, aur unke seene se rotay hue aisi aawaz aa rahi thi jaise deg ki aawaz hoti hai."
"322","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmud bin Ghaylan, qala: Haddasana Mu'awiyah bin Hisham, qala: Haddasana Sufyan, 'an Al-A'mash, 'an Ibrahim, 'an 'Ubaydah, 'an Abdullah bin Mas'ud, qala: Mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere samne qirat karo. Main ne arz ki: Ya Rasoolullah! Main aapke samne qirat karoon, halanke aap par hi nazil hua hai? Aapne farmaya: Mujhe kisi aur se sunna pasand hai. Chunanche main ne Surah An-Nisa padhi, yahan tak ke pahuncha ""aur hum tumhein in par gawah le kar aayenge"", farmaya: Toh main ne Rasoolullah ki dono aankhon se ansoo beh rahe dekhe."
"323","[AI-translation] Hamay Qutaiba ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamay Jareer ne hadees bayan ki, Ataa bin As-Saa'ib se, un ke waalid se, Abdullah bin Amr se, kehne lagay: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke 'ahad mein ek din sooraj grahan ho gaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) namaaz padhne ke liye khade ho gaye, yahan tak ke mushkil se ruku karte, phir ruku kiya, to mushkil se sar uthate, phir sar uthaya, to mushkil se sajda karte, phir sajda kiya, to mushkil se sar uthate, phir sar uthaya, to mushkil se sajda karte, phir sajda kiya, to mushkil se sar uthate. Phir woh phoonkne aur rone lage, aur kehne lage: Aye Rab! Kya Tu ne mujh se waada nahi kiya tha ke jab main un mein hoon to Tu unhein azaab nahi dega? Aye Rab! Kya Tu ne mujh se waada nahi kiya tha ke jab woh daryaft-e-maafi karte hain to Tu unhein azaab nahi dega? Aur hum Teri daryaft-e-maafi karte hain. Phir jab do rak'at namaaz padh li, to sooraj khul gaya. To woh khade hue aur Allah ta'ala ki hamd ki, aur us ki sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: Sooraj aur chaand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, kisi ki maut ki wajah se ya kisi ki zindagi ki wajah se yeh grahan nahi hote. Pas jab yeh grahan hon, to Allah ta'ala ke zikr ki taraf bhaago."
"324","[AI-translation] Hamay Mahmood bin Ghaylan ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamay Abu Ahmad ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamay Sufyan ne hadees bayan ki, Ataa bin As-Saa'ib se, un se 'Ikrimah se, un se Ibn 'Abbas se, kehne lagay: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne apni ek beti ko jo dam tod rahi thi, utha liya aur aaghosh mein le kar unhein apne saamne rakh diya. Woh un ke saamne hi inteqaal kar gayi aur Umm Aiman cheekh padi. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum Rasoolullah ke saamne ro rahi ho? Unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhein rota hua nahi dekh rahi hoon? Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main to nahi ro raha, yeh to sirf rehmat hai. Momin har haal mein har khair mein hai, us ki jaan us ke pehluon ke darmiyan se nikalti hai aur woh Allah ta'ala ki hamd karta hai."
"325","[AI-translation] Hamay Muhammad bin Bashaar ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamay Abd-ur-Rahmaan bin Mahdi ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamay Sufyan ne hadees bayan ki, 'Aasim bin 'Ubaidullah se, un se Qaasim bin Muhammad se, un se 'Aa'ishah se, ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne 'Uthmaan bin Maz'oon ko jo mayyat tha chuma, aur aap ro rahe thay ya farmaya: un ki aankhein beh rahi thin."
"326","[AI-translation] Hamay Ishaq bin Mansoor ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamay Abu 'Aamir ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hamay Fulaih aur woh bin Sulaimaan hain, ne hadees bayan ki, Hilaal bin 'Ali se, un se Anas bin Maalik se, kehne lagay: Hum Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki ek beti (ke janaze) mein haazir hue, aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) qabr par baithay hue thay. To main ne aap ki aankhein aansu bahate hue dekhe. To aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi aisa aadmi hai jis ne is raat (apni zauja se) ham bistari na ki ho? Abu Talhah ne kaha: Main. Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Neeche utro. To woh un ke qabr mein utar gaye."
"327","[AI-translation] Hamay 'Ali bin Hujar ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamay 'Ali bin Mushir ne hadees bayan ki, Hishaam bin 'Urwah se, un ke waalid se, un se 'Aa'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ka bistar jis par aap soyte the chamde ka tha, jis mein khajoor ke daaton ka bhosaa bhara hua tha."
"328","[AI-translation] Ham se Abu Al-Khattab Ziyad bin Yahya Al-Basri ne riwayat ki, kehte hain ham se 'Abdullah bin Maimun ne riwayat ki, kehte hain ham se Ja'far bin Muhammad ne apne waalid se riwayat ki, kehte hain 'Aisha se aur Hafsa se poocha gaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ka farsh aapke ghar mein kya tha? Unhone kaha: Ek kapra tha jise hum dohri tah kar deti theen aur aap us par so jate the. Phir jab ek raat aayi to maine kaha: Agar isay char tah kar diya jaye to aap ke liye zyada narm ho jayega. To hum ne aap ke liye char tah kar diya. Phir jab subah ho gayi to aap ne farmaya: Aaj raat tum ne mere liye kya bichaya? Unhone kaha: Hum ne kaha: Yeh aap ka hi farsh hai magar hum ne isay char tah kar diya hai, hum ne kaha ke yeh aap ke liye zyada narm hai. Aap ne farmaya: Ise apni pehli halat par wapas kar do, kyunke is ki narmi ne mujhe aaj raat ki namaz se rok diya hai."
"329","[AI-translation] Ham se Ahmad bin Mani', Sa'id bin 'Abd al-Rahman Al-Makhzumi aur dusre logon ne riwayat ki, kehte hain: Ham se Sufyan bin 'Uyaynah ne riwayat ki, Al-Zuhri se, 'Ubaidullah se, Ibn 'Abbas se, 'Umar bin Al-Khattab se. Unhone kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mujh mein ghulu na karo jis tarah Nasara ne Maryam ke bete mein ghulu kiya, main sirf ek banda hoon, to tum kaho: Allah ka banda aur us ka Rasool."
"330","[AI-translation] Ham se 'Ali bin Hujr ne riwayat ki, kehte hain: Ham se Suwaid bin 'Abd al-'Aziz ne riwayat ki, Humaid se, Anas bin Malik se, ke ek aurat Nabi (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi, aur usne aap se kaha: Mera aapse koi kaam (hajat) hai. To aap ne farmaya: Madinah ke kisi bhi raste mein jahan chaho baith jao, main tumhare paas aa kar baithunga."
